      * RPG III CALL, PARM and PLIST
     H
      * Fields
     C                     MOVEL'ABC'     NAME    5
     C                     Z-ADD7         CNT     50
      * CALL with its PARM lines
     C                     CALL 'PGMA'
     C                     PARM           NAME
     C                     PARM           CNT
      * Same program, error indicator
     C                     CALL 'PGMA'                 91
     C                     PARM           NAME
     C                     PARM           CNT
      * PLIST, parameter defined by its length, value moved before and after
     C           PLST1     PLIST
     C           'X'       PARM           CODE    1
     C           NAME      PARM BACK      SAVE    5
     C                     CALL 'PGMB'    PLST1
      * Not converted
     C                     CALL PGMNM
     C                     CALL 'LIB/PGM'
     C                     CALL 'PGMA'
     C                     PARM           CODE
     C                     CALL 'PGMC'    PLST9
     C                     CALL 'PGMA'                   92
     C                     PARM           NAME
     C                     PARM           CNT
     C           *ENTRY    PLIST
     C                     PARM           P1      3
     C                     MOVEL'A'       X1      1
     C                     PARM           NAME
